      "id": "2126502014037192741",
      "text": "End of 3: Pistons 90, Bucks 76. Daniss closed the quarter with a deep 3 at the buzzer, because that’s what he does. Pistons dominated the 3rd, 42-26, shooting 63.6% overall (14-22) while holding the Bucks to 10-23 (43.5%). Two-way guard Harkless has 13 points and 7 assists",
      "url": "https://x.com/omarisankofa/status/2126502014037192741",
