    },
    {
      "id": "2126491041033498686",
      "text": "Halftime: Bucks 50, Pistons 48. Pistons are shooting just 36.4% overall and 32% (8-25) from 3. But after a slow defensive start, they held the Bucks to 38.1% (8-21) in the 2nd quarter. Joe (11 points), Reed (10 pts) and Harkless (7 pts, 6 assists) are carrying the offense.",
      "url": "https://x.com/omarisankofa/status/2126491041033498686",
      "published": "2026-11-28T01:39:07+00:00",
