    {
      "id": "2126514805972381859",
      "text": "JB on Harkless: \"He’s a competitor. He fits right in with who we are. The doggedness to him, the grit to him, the way he gets after you defensively and the things he can do on the offensive end … it’s about his character and spirit and he fits Pistons basketball.\"",
